["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"The AI Factory: Infrastructure for Intelligence | Jensen Huang, CEO, NVIDIA AI factory agentic AI self-supervised learning physical AI TAM\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-02-01-ch-cisco-黄仁勋-你不愿公开的问题-才是公司最值钱的知识产权/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a5ea8055a378435f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">43:02</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Cisco</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0201</span></div>\n<h2>黄仁勋：你不愿公开的问题，才是公司最值钱的知识产权</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">英伟达把自己的对话系统留在本地，不是因为答案敏感，而是因为「我在问什么」比「AI给了什么答案」更有价值——这条逻辑被他用来反对「全部上云」的默认选择。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI基础设施</span><span class=\"tag\">企业AI战略</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"FULL CONVERSATION: Elon Musk Reveals AI, Space &amp; Robotics Plans to Secure Humanity’s Future | AQ1B Starship Optimus full self-driving (FSD)\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-02-01-ch-drm-news-马斯克-今年芯片产能就会超过电力供应-瓶颈是电不是芯片/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/fd0549cbbd71aefb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">32:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">DRM News</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0201</span></div>\n<h2>马斯克：今年芯片产能就会超过电力供应，瓶颈是电不是芯片</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">马斯克称AI芯片产量正在指数级增长，而美国电网扩容每年只有4%到10%，今年或最迟明年芯片产能就会追上甚至超过能通电的上限。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI算力</span><span class=\"tag\">机器人</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"LIVE: Elon Musk in Conversation with Larry Fink at Davos World Economic Forum | AI1G\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-02-01-ch-drm-news-马斯克-太阳能将让空间成为建ai数据中心最便宜的地方/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0c356733fd484889-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">47:59</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">DRM News</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0201</span></div>\n<h2>马斯克：太阳能将让空间成为建AI数据中心最便宜的地方</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">马斯克预测今年AI就可能超越单个人类智力，而限制AI扩张的瓶颈不是芯片而是电力，这也是他押注太空太阳能数据中心的根本原因。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">电力瓶颈</span><span class=\"tag\">太空数据中心</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Elon Musk – &quot;In 36 months, the cheapest place to put AI will be space” mass driver Kardashev scale reticle autoclave sim-to-real gap\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-02-01-ch-dwarkesh-patel-and-2-more-马斯克断言-三年内把ai算力送上太空会比在地球发电更便宜/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/51a4d508f3ecbd54-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">2:49:46</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Dwarkesh Patel and 2 more</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0201</span></div>\n<h2>马斯克断言：三年内把AI算力送上太空会比在地球发电更便宜</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他的论证是：地球电力产出基本停滞，而太空光伏不受大气和昼夜影响，发电效率提升五倍，还省掉电池，综合成本只有地面的十分之一。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">太空算力</span><span class=\"tag\">能源瓶颈</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Elon Musk Joins Panel Discussion at WEF | AC1P full reusability Optimus\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-02-01-ch-news-central-马斯克预测今年ai将比任何人都聪明-2031年超越全人类/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/db9c6609a1ff9232-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">48:56</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">News Central</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0201</span></div>\n<h2>马斯克预测今年AI将比任何人都聪明，2031年超越全人类</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">马斯克把太阳能、全复用火箭和人形机器人连成一条逻辑：电力是AI部署的真正瓶颈，而成本最低的AI数据中心最终会建在太空里。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">太阳能</span><span class=\"tag\">太空发射</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"CEO Fireside Chat With Jensen Huang and Pascal Daloz at Dassault Systèmes 3DEXPERIENCE World world model Physics Nemo MBSE\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-02-01-ch-nvidia-英伟达与达索的25年合作-从opengl到ai世界模型/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/31f8b10218ccd6f5-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">37:04</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">NVIDIA</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0201</span></div>\n<h2>英伟达与达索的25年合作：从OpenGL到AI世界模型</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">黄仁勋认为下一代设计工具不再靠人写结构化几何数据，而是靠AI理解物理法则和因果关系的「世界模型」，这是比语言模型更难的一步。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">数字孪生</span><span class=\"tag\">世界模型</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Tesla CEO Elon Musk speaks at The World Economic Forum Starship Optimus Full Self Driving (FSD) Robotaxi\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-02-01-ch-yahoo-finance-马斯克-限制ai扩张的不是芯片产能-而是电力/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f858824fc5b02c9a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"Y\"><span class=\"dur\">28:45</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Yahoo Finance</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0201</span></div>\n<h2>马斯克：限制AI扩张的不是芯片产能，而是电力</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">马斯克说芯片产能很快就会超过电网能承载的电量，而中国靠光伏新增产能遥遥领先——电力而非芯片，才是未来几年AI扩张的真正瓶颈。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">人工智能</span><span class=\"tag\">机器人</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"131. 印奇出任阶跃星辰董事长的访谈：聪明人的诱惑、取舍、超长链路残酷淘汰赛、阶跃函数和超多元方程 VLA foundation model edge MVP\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-01-26-zhangxiaojun-印奇出任阶跃星辰董事长-基模公司做2b和纯2c都不成立/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ae74dec7a752a3fc-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">2:01:27</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0126</span></div>\n<h2>印奇出任阶跃星辰董事长：基模公司做2B和纯2C都不成立</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">基模一年至少烧30亿人民币、要维持三到五年，所以做2B或纯C端软件都算不过账；阶跃的赌注是基模加终端，用软硬一体换一张上牌桌的资格。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>3</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">大模型</span><span class=\"tag\">商业化</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"[LIVE] #WEF2026: Conversation with Elon Musk | 22 Jan 2026 Starship Optimus\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-01-22-ch-astro-awani-马斯克-ai扩张的真正瓶颈不是芯片-而是电力/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/40d47ad12bf3fb81-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">32:51</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Astro AWANI</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0122</span></div>\n<h2>马斯克：AI扩张的真正瓶颈不是芯片，而是电力</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">马斯克说芯片产能很快就会过剩，真正卡住AI与机器人扩张速度的是电力供应，这也是SpaceX和特斯拉联手三年内建成每年100吉瓦太阳能产能的原因。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">能源</span><span class=\"tag\">机器人</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"130. 张月光创业两年首次访谈：妙鸭不是AI Native产品、流程到上下文设计、One Way Door和乙女游戏 AI Native One Way Door Live2D Context Engineering Q-Time / Save Time\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-01-22-zhangxiaojun-妙鸭不是-ai-native-产品-它只是把-ai-用好的互联网产品/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/84b4403959914648-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">3:14:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0122</span></div>\n<h2>妙鸭不是 AI Native 产品：它只是把 AI 用好的互联网产品</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">张月光复盘两年创业：妙鸭靠限制用户自由度换取稳定效果，本质是互联网产品思维；AI Native 产品要换成面向 context 的设计，而单向门产品才是他愿意押上全部身家的东西。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>3</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 产品</span><span class=\"tag\">创业</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"[LIVE] #WEF2026: Conversation with Jensen Huang, President and CEO of NVIDIA | 21th Jan 2026 agentic AI / agentic systems physical AI / physical intelligence AI native companies\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-01-21-ch-astro-awani-黄仁勋-ai不是裁员工具-而是在制造劳动力短缺/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/29e9678935293569-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">34:10</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Astro AWANI</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0121</span></div>\n<h2>黄仁勋：AI不是裁员工具，而是在制造劳动力短缺</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">黄仁勋用放射科医生和护士的真实案例论证：AI自动化的是任务而非目的，结果反而是医院扩招而不是裁员，这与AI威胁就业的主流叙事相反。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI基础设施</span><span class=\"tag\">就业影响</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"刘震云×罗永浩！有些玩笑含着泪也要开完\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-01-15-cn2d7912-乡村不是没有天才-而是天才没赶上恢复高考/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c5efb79bd917b306-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"罗\"><span class=\"dur\">4:27:47</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">罗永浩的十字路口</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0115</span></div>\n<h2>乡村不是没有天才，而是天才没赶上恢复高考</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">如果不是恢复高考，刘震云现在还在种地；他那位边种地边解微积分的表哥，很可能本该拿物理诺贝尔奖。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">文学创作</span><span class=\"tag\">乡土中国</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"EP1 刘嘉玲说，60岁是她的黄金时代\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-01-13-xiaotianzhang-趁体力还在-刘嘉玲说60到70岁才是她的黄金时代/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2805c831609a7cd9-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"小\"><span class=\"dur\">1:19:52</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">小天章</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0113</span></div>\n<h2>趁体力还在：刘嘉玲说60到70岁才是她的黄金时代</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">她说70岁后体力撑不住旅行与应酬，60到70岁反而是情绪最稳定、最该趁现在去埃及、耶路撒冷这些心愿地的十年。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">衰老心态</span><span class=\"tag\">婚姻相处</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Lovart 创始人陈冕×罗永浩！且让我大闹一场，然后悄然离去 AI native reward model AGI Agent\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-01-09-cn2d7912-ai十年内不会让人类没用-这是陈冕押上全部身家的赌注/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/21e3cf477d7561e6-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"罗\"><span class=\"dur\">3:43:55</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">罗永浩的十字路口</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0109</span></div>\n<h2>AI十年内不会让人类没用：这是陈冕押上全部身家的赌注</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">如果AI十年内学不会人类的品味和判断，像Lovart这样需要人介入的设计产品就还有价值；一旦判断错，公司也会跟着完蛋。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI创业</span><span class=\"tag\">产品策略</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"129. 全球大模型第一股的上市访谈，和智谱CEO张鹏聊：敢问路在何方？ MAS Test Time Scaling VLA\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-01-08-zhangxiaojun-全球大模型第一股上市了-张鹏说中国-ai-没有泡沫/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/96bd8c162ef0083d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">2:26:39</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0108</span></div>\n<h2>全球大模型第一股上市了，张鹏说中国 AI 没有泡沫</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美国资本市场可能有泡沫，中国不存在——中国投 AI 的钱只有美国的二十几分之一，远远不够。张鹏的逻辑是：离 AGI 还远、钱还不够，就更得投，不投它不会自然发生。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">大模型</span><span class=\"tag\">开源</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"LIVE | Elon Musk Speaks at WEF Davos 2026 | APT Starship Full Self-Driving (FSD) Robotaxi\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-01-01-ch-apt-马斯克达沃斯预言-今年ai就超越最聪明的人类/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/08a07243447cbb75-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">30:46</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">APT</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0101</span></div>\n<h2>马斯克达沃斯预言：今年AI就超越最聪明的人类</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">马斯克称人形机器人的终局是全人类人手一个、数量超过人口，电力而非芯片才是AI扩张的真正瓶颈，中国光伏产能足以满足半个美国用电量。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">能源</span><span class=\"tag\">人形机器人</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"WATCH: Elon Musk Speaks at WEF 2026 | AI, Space &amp; Global Tech Insights | AI15\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-01-01-ch-dws-news-马斯克-ai扩张的瓶颈不是芯片-是电力跟不上/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ec48e1ed107a5957-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">16:56</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">DWS News</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0101</span></div>\n<h2>马斯克：AI扩张的瓶颈不是芯片，是电力跟不上</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">马斯克在达沃斯世界经济论坛上说，AI芯片产能已经在指数增长，但电力并网增速只有百分之三四，电力正成为AI部署的根本限制。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">电力瓶颈</span><span class=\"tag\">AI算力</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Tesla Q1 2026 Financial Results and Q&amp;A Webcast TerraFab unsupervised FSD S-curve micro factories\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-01-01-ch-tesla-特斯拉认了-hardware-3-永远无法实现无监督自动驾驶/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1916bc85d18b7571-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:05:20</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Tesla</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0101</span></div>\n<h2>特斯拉认了：Hardware 3 永远无法实现无监督自动驾驶</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Hardware 3 的内存带宽只有 Hardware 4 的八分之一，官方首次明确这一代硬件做不到无监督 FSD，车主只能付费换装新硬件才能进入无人出租车车队。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">自动驾驶</span><span class=\"tag\">人形机器人</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"128. Manus决定出售前最后的访谈：啊，这奇幻的2025年漂流啊… compaction awareness Remote Labor Index TIR RLVR latent reasoning\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-12-30-zhangxiaojun-manus-决定出售前最后访谈-ai-没有蛮荒期-因为没新平台/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4744d9a1060b8431-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">3:31:17</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">2025</span></div>\n<h2>Manus 决定出售前最后访谈：AI 没有蛮荒期，因为没新平台</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">移动互联网的蛮荒期来自硬件换代，桌面到手机让巨头和个人开发者众生平等；AI 技术突破更大，却没有出现全新平台，所以巨头、创业公司、个人开发者反应一样快，蛮荒期不存在。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>20</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI Agent</span><span class=\"tag\">Manus</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"影石Insta360 创始人刘靖康×罗永浩！比生存更重要的是那些微小的念头 337 Investigation NPE PMF DFM\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-12-25-cn2d7912-硬刚大疆做无人机-他们图的不是打败对手/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/096fe60475239ebc-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"罗\"><span class=\"dur\">4:24:37</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">罗永浩的十字路口</span>\n<span class=\"date\">2025</span></div>\n<h2>硬刚大疆做无人机，他们图的不是打败对手</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">消费级无人机此前几乎全军覆没，他们明知如此仍进场，理由不是抢市场，而是做无人机能一次性把公司的技术、制造、供应链能力拉到新台阶，帮企业穿越下一个周期。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">硬件创业</span><span class=\"tag\">供应链管理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"127. 大模型季报跨年对谈：和广密预言一场AI War、两大联盟和第三个范式Online Learning Online Learning Agentic Web Neo Labs Credit Assignment\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-12-24-zhangxiaojun-ai不是泡沫-是巨头砸光最后一分钱也不下牌桌的战争/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a70c3ff97f6ae434-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:18:02</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">2025</span></div>\n<h2>AI不是泡沫，是巨头砸光最后一分钱也不下牌桌的战争</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">所谓 AI 泡沫，是拿商业回报算出来的账；巨头把它当成新的国防或核武器，算的是被颠覆的风险——所以宁可砸光最后一分钱，也不轻易下牌桌。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">大模型</span><span class=\"tag\">AGI</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"126. 和红杉郑庆生聊：经济史的流量革命、人类行为模式的不可预期，与创始人性格 双边网络效应 PMF 幸存者偏差\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-12-21-zhangxiaojun-ai-时代的网络没有自然垄断-边际成本不趋近于零/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/49045e811e1dea1b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:43:06</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">2025</span></div>\n<h2>AI 时代的网络没有自然垄断，边际成本不趋近于零</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">互联网产品是巨大的城镇，边际成本趋近于零所以赢家通吃；AI 每多一个用户就多一份 token 成本，这个差别会改写流量节点的商业设计。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 投资</span><span class=\"tag\">流量</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"导演大鹏×罗永浩！我这两辈子\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-12-17-cn2d7912-大鹏-我好像活了两辈子-上辈子总被保安轰-被粉丝踩/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/225eff6d82f85e3d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"罗\"><span class=\"dur\">5:02:21</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">罗永浩的十字路口</span>\n<span class=\"date\">2025</span></div>\n<h2>大鹏：我好像活了两辈子，上辈子总被保安轰、被粉丝踩</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">大鹏说自己好像活了两辈子：上一辈子他穿短裤在电影节红毯尽头被保安呵斥、在直播现场被粉丝踩在脚底下；这一辈子他走红毯、领奖，迎面喊他名字的还是当年那群记者。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">人物访谈</span><span class=\"tag\">创业者成长</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"125. Freda的投资札记第1集：下注OpenAI、Robinhood往事，美国资本坏小孩、算盘与泡沫 Crossover Scaling Law Single GM Prediction Market Agentic Commerce Neo Labs\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-12-16-zhangxiaojun-openai-的商业模式是负向滚雪球-越烧越亏/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f93330d12f4107e9-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:24:26</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">2025</span></div>\n<h2>OpenAI 的商业模式是负向滚雪球，越烧越亏</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">模型公司每年要拿上一年的训练成本乘以十去烧下一代模型，收入却只按上一年的两倍回收，加 2 减 10，现金流年年更负。只有停止烧钱那天，利润表才会突然好看。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">OpenAI</span><span class=\"tag\">Anthropic</span>\n</div></div></a>"]